{"id": "x0233", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, it's kind of hard to say exactly where mountain bi king was born. There are a few different places that people point to as the birth place of mountain biking. Some people say that it started in the early 1970s when some guys in California started riding their bike s on trails and hillsides near their homes. Others say that it started in Europe, particularly in Switzerland or France, where people were riding their bikes down steep mountain trail s for fun. But regardless of where it actually started, one thing is clear: mountain bi king has become an incredibly popular sport around the world, with millions of people taking part each year.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
